  "description": "IntelliDataSort is a high-performance, culture-aware sorting and parsing library for .NET, designed to safely handle real-world mixed data.\n\n\t\t\tIt supports robust sorting of numbers, dates, file sizes, percentages, IP addresses, natural strings, versions, and currencies, with strong validation to prevent malformed, ambiguous, or malicious inputs.\n\n\t\t\tThe library guarantees stable sorting, configurable string comparison rules, detailed parsed-value extraction, and strict edge-case handling across international formats.",
